<title>BELGIUM: Belgium raises liquidity at money tender.</title>
<headline>Belgium raises liquidity at money tender.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1996-11-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Belgian National Bank raised liquidity at its fixed-rate tender for seven-day advances. Details -</p>
<p>    Value date 27/12	  expiry on 04/12    NBVA</p>
<p>    Amount allotted	   13.575 bln bfr    (13.275 bln *)</p>
<p>    Interest rate	     3.00 pct	    (3.00 pct **)</p>
<p>    Total amount of bids    13.575 bln bfr</p>
<p>Percentage of bids accepted  100</p>
<p>* amount draining from the money market on Nov 27</p>
<p>** interest rate at previous tender on Nov 18</p>
<p>-- Brussels Newsroom +32 2 287 6810, Fax +32 2 230 7710</p>
</text>
